        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 98C2001, 98C Series Traditional Spring Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, or polished chrome finishes, the 98C Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The classic steeped mounts look will look great in any traditional decor. This wall mounted toilet tissue dispenser is made out of brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2001-specifications.gif?v=1704442276\" width=\"415\" height=\"394\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 98C2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=382603\"><b>Deltana 98C Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 98C Solid Brass Double Post Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Recommended Installation Arm Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2001.pdf?v=1691095372\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 98C2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
